#: dialogs/pdf-wizard/pdfdialog.cpp:819
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Applies a PDF watermark to the background of a single input PDF. Pdftk uses "
"only the first page from the background PDF and applies it to every page of "
"the input PDF. This page is scaled and rotated as needed to fit the input "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Primjenjuje PDF vodeni žig na pozadinu jednog ulaznog PDF-a. Pdftk koristi samo prvu stranicu iz pozadinskog PDF-a i primjenjuje je na svaku stranicu ulaznog PDF-a. Ova se stranica skalira i okreće prema potrebi da stane na ulaznu stranicu."

#: dialogs/pdf-wizard/pdfdialog.cpp:824
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Applies a foreground stamp on top of the input PDF document's pages. Pdftk "
"uses only the first page from the stamp PDF and applies it to every page of "
"the input PDF. This page is scaled and rotated as needed to fit the input "
"page. This works best if the stamp PDF page has a transparent background."
msgstr ""
"Stavlja pečat u prednji plan na vrh stranica ulaznog PDF dokumenta. Pdftk koristi samo prvu stranicu PDF-a oznake i primjenjuje je na svaku stranicu ulaznog PDF-a. Ova se stranica skalira i rotira po potrebi kako bi stala na ulaznu stranicu. Ovo najbolje funkcionira ako PDF stranica s markom ima prozirnu pozadinu."

