#: kilestdactions.cpp:151
#, kde-format
msgid "Tabbing - \\begin{tabbing}"
msgstr ""
"Tabbing - \\begin{tabbing}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:154
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The tabbing environment provides a way to align text in columns.\n"
"\\begin{tabbing}\n"
"text \\= more text \\= still more text \\= last text \\\\\n"
"second row \\&gt;  \\&gt; more \\\\\n"
"\\end{tabbing}\n"
"Commands :\n"
"\\=  Sets a tab stop at the current position.\n"
"\\>  Advances to the next tab stop.\n"
"\\&lt;  Allows you to put something to the left of the local margin without "
"changing the margin. Can only be used at the start of the line.\n"
"\\+  Moves the left margin of the next and all the following commands one "
"tab stop to the right\n"
"\\-  Moves the left margin of the next and all the following commands one "
"tab stop to the left\n"
"\\' Moves everything that you have typed so far in the current column to the "
"right of the previous column, flush against the current column's tab stop. \n"
"\\`  Allows you to put text flush right against any tab stop, including tab "
"stop 0\n"
"\\kill  Sets tab stops without producing text.\n"
"\\a  In a tabbing environment, the commands \\=, \\' and \\` do not produce "
"accents as normal. Instead, the commands \\a=, \\a' and \\a` are used."
msgstr ""
"Okruženje s karticama pruža način za poravnavanje teksta u stupcima.\n"
"\\begin{tabbing}\n"
"tekst \\= više teksta \\= još teksta \\= posljednji tekst \\\\ZXQNL0000ZXQdrugi red \\&gt; \\&gt; više \\\\ZXQNL0000ZXQ\\end{tabbing}\n"
"Naredbe :\n"
"\\= Postavlja tabulator na trenutnu poziciju.\n"
"\\> Napreduje do sljedećeg tabulatora.\n"
"\\&lt; Omogućuje vam da stavite nešto lijevo od lokalne margine bez mijenjanja margine. Može se koristiti samo na početku retka.\n"
"\\+ Pomiče lijevu marginu sljedeće i svih sljedećih naredbi za jedan tabulator udesno\n"
"\\- Pomiče lijevu marginu sljedeće i svih sljedećih naredbi za jedan tabulator ulijevo\n"
"\\' Pomiče sve što ste do sada upisali u trenutnom stupcu desno od prethodnog stupca, u ravnini s tabulatorom trenutnog stupca. \n"
"\\`  Allows you to put text flush right against any tab stop, including tab stop 0ZXQNL0000ZXQ\\kill  Sets tab stops without producing text.ZXQNL0000ZXQ\\a  In a tabbing environment, the commands \\=, \\' and \\` ne proizvode naglaske kao obično. Umjesto toga, koriste se naredbe \\a=, \\a' i \\a`."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:155
#, kde-format
msgid "Tabular - \\begin{tabular}"
msgstr ""
"Tabular - \\begin{tabular}"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:158
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{tabular}[pos]{cols}\n"
"column 1 entry & column 2 entry ... & column n entry \\\\\n"
"...\n"
"\\end{tabular}\n"
"pos : Specifies the vertical position; default is alignment on the center of "
"the environment.\n"
"     t - align on top row\n"
"     b - align on bottom row\n"
"cols : Specifies the column formatting.\n"
"     l - A column of left-aligned items.\n"
"     r - A column of right-aligned items.\n"
"     c - A column of centered items.\n"
"     | - A vertical line the full height and depth of the environment.\n"
"     @{text} - this inserts text in every row.\n"
"The \\hline command draws a horizontal line the width of the table.\n"
"The \\cline{i-j} command draws horizontal lines across the columns "
"specified, beginning in column i and ending in column j.\n"
"The \\vline command draws a vertical line extending the full height and "
"depth of its row."
msgstr ""
"\\begin{tabular}[pos]{cols}\n"
"unos stupca 1 & unos stupca 2 ... & unos stupca n \\\\ZXQNL0000ZXQ...\n"
"\\end{tabular}\n"
"pos : Određuje okomiti položaj; zadano je poravnanje u sredini okruženja. \n"
" t - poravnaj na gornji red \n"
" b - poravnaj na donji red\n"
"cols : Određuje oblikovanje stupca. \n"
" l - Stupac stavki poravnatih lijevo. \n"
" r - Stupac desno poravnatih stavki.\n"
" c - Stupac centriranih stavki.\n"
" | - Okomita linija pune visine i dubine okruženja. \n"
" @{text} - ovo umeće tekst u svaki red. \n"
" Naredba \\hline crta vodoravnu liniju širine tablice. \n"
" Naredba \\cline{i-j} crta vodoravne linije preko navedenih stupaca, počevši od stupca i i završava u stupcu j.\n"
"Naredba \\vline crta okomitu liniju koja se proteže cijelom visinom i dubinom svog retka."

#: kilestdactions.cpp:159
#, kde-format
msgid "Multicolumn Cells - \\multicolumn"
msgstr ""
"Ćelije s više stupaca - \\multicolumn"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:159
#, kde-format
msgid "Multicolumn Cells"
msgstr ""
"Ćelije s više stupaca"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:162
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\\multicolumn{cols}{pos}{text}\n"
"col, specifies the number of columns to span.\n"
"pos specifies the formatting of the entry: c for centered, l for flushleft, "
"r for flushright.\n"
"text specifies what text is to make up the entry."
msgstr ""
"\\multicolumn{cols}{pos}{text}\n"
"col, navodi broj stupaca koji treba obuhvatiti. \n"
"pos određuje formatiranje unosa: c za središte, l za ravno lijevo, r za ravno desno. \n"
"tekst određuje koji će tekst činiti unos."

