#: kilestdactions.cpp:413
#, kde-format
msgid "Vertical Space (forced)"
msgstr ""
"Okomiti razmak (prisilno)"

#: kilestdactions.cpp:416
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \\vspace* command adds vertical space like the \\vspace command. LaTeX "
"removes vertical space that comes at the end of a page. If you do not want "
"LaTeX to remove this space, include the optional * argument. Then the space "
"is never removed."
msgstr ""
"Naredba \\vspace* dodaje okomiti prostor poput naredbe \\vspace. LaTeX uklanja okomiti prostor koji dolazi na kraju stranice. Ako ne želite da LaTeX ukloni ovaj razmak, uključite izborni argument *. Tada se razmak nikada ne uklanja."

